  _signatureText: 'At two thirds of its health it bursts into three shards that each take a different route: one runs its own road, one flies the air route and one takes the second road, each with a third of what it had left. At a third the surviving shards pull back together where the one nearest your base stands. Each shard you killed takes 30% off the giant that forms.'
  _telegraphText: It breaks out of a sealed gate in the old ruins. Near its split point cracks of light pulse on its body, and when it bursts each shard's route lights up briefly.
  _counterText: 'Cover every route: air defence and the second front matter. Kill one shard fast and the rejoined giant is weaker; let them run and it forms closer to your base.'
